 salary, is not subject to indexation, and is not included in the calculation of holiday pay or any year&#8209;end premium</span></div><div style="padding-left:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(2) Represents employer pension contributions under applicable non&#8209;U.S. retirement arrangements for Ms. Noblet</span></div><div style="padding-left:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(3) Represents tax gross&#8209;up payments provided to offset the tax impact of certain Company&#8209;related expenses for Ms. Noblet</span></div><div style="height:50.4pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">41</span></div></div></div><div id="id91220209561457081d11d3d687be3e4_106"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:50.4pt;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#id91220209561457081d11d3d687be3e4_10">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Grants of Plan-Based Awards in 2025</span></div><div style="text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:97.977%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:14.770%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:8.607%"/><td style="width:0.1%